=You are an expert website copywriter and business consultant.

Generate custom website content for this business:

Business Name: {{$json.name}}
Category: {{$json.category}}
Location: {{$json.location}}
Phone: {{$json.phone}}
Custom tagline (if provided): {{$json.tagline}}

Return ONLY valid JSON with this structure:
{
  "hero_headline": "compelling 10-15 word headline for the homepage hero",
  "hero_sub": "2-3 sentence description of what this business does and why customers should choose them",
  "services": [
    {"icon": "3-4 CHAR ABBREV", "name": "Service Name", "desc": "One sentence description"}
  ],
  "blog_topics": [
    ["SEO-optimized blog post title", "One sentence subtitle describing the content"]
  ],
  "cta_headline": "Call-to-action section headline",
  "cta_sub": "Supporting sentence for the CTA",
  "footer_tagline": "Short brand tagline for footer (5-8 words)"
}

Provide:
- 6-8 services specific to this business category and name
- 5 blog topics that would rank in Google for this business type and location
- Make all copy specific to the business name and location
- Hero headline should be powerful and specific, not generic
- If a custom tagline was provided, use it as the hero_headline

Return ONLY the JSON object, no markdown, no explanation.

